Recommends: certbot
Description: NexusOS Gateway (native NGINX reverse proxy)
 Connects the native NGINX web server to the NexusOS declarative route
 registry in /etc/nexusos/gateway. Routes, certificates and activation are
 managed from the Command Center or `nexus gateway`; NGINX is reloaded only
 after `nginx -t` succeeds, with automatic rollback.
 .
 Installing this package does not publish anything: no route is active until
 a user approves it.
